OL,3,GNEWSA'Our son will never be the same
OL,4,Aafter random attack'
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a statement, his family said: "The
OL,7,Fdoctors have told us that we will not
OL,8,Fget the old Amari back. We do not know
OL,9,Fwhat his future will look like, whether
OL,10,Fhe will ever come home, or what level
OL,11,Fof care he may need. Our whole family
OL,12,Fhas changed."
